<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           都很棒！\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 41, 65);text-decoration: underline;\">\n           (也门，莎朵的Lot12厌氧日晒和前景的日晒3个批次各有2小包，大家可以单独做个横向对比他们的果味，酸甜和可可感酒感的差异）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           大家新年复工快乐！\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;text-decoration-thickness: auto;text-decoration-style: solid;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q0sawsrNuEBTlj8u2G09ax1xgH4tnoj8XGcqcB0xq0qpiamG0OGs3xP4S0y0Off9n6e47StF5lXdg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp#imgIndex=0\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;vertical-align: bottom;height: auto !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 17px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 556.1875px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section